{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30615","headline":"和主司王起 · 金厚载","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长庆曾收间世英，果居台阁冠公卿。\n天书再受恩波远，金榜三开日月明。\n已见差肩趍翰苑，更期连步掌台衡。\n小儒谬蹟云霄路，心仰莲峰望太清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"金厚载","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}